			<div class="content" id="post-content-3652232">
									

<p>Now I remember what this reminded me of! The original Arabic title of the Necronomicon was the al-Azif, referring to the nocturnal sounds (presumably caused by insects) attributed to the howling of demons. Lovecraft derived this from a footnote in a translation of &quot;Vathek&quot;.</p>
<p>This is a great use of big scary bugs.</p>

